@startuml
title JOB-01 - daily00:05 lifecycle and recovery (REVIEW)
autonumber
participant "Daily runner / authorized admin" as W
participant "Job run / checkpoint" as J
participant "Accounts" as A
participant "Subscriptions / cancellation" as R
participant "Shared renewal core" as S
W -> J : create run with business target and caller audit
loop expired account batch
 W -> A : recheck expiry/state
 A --> W : EXPIRED, preserve balance and history
 W -> J : progress only after committed effect
end
loop due subscription batch
 W -> R : recheck state, coverageEnd and receipt
 alt PENDING_CANCEL and coverageEnd reached
  W -> R : CANCELLED at end of all paid coverage
 else renewal already completed by worker/manual
  R --> W : skip, no second fee
 else auto renewal eligible / technical backlog
  W -> S : same cycle attempt and Q25 rules
  S --> W : one new cycle / final failure / bounded technical retry
 else no renewal
  W -> R : EXPIRED, retain cycles/history
 end
 W -> J : persist progress/counts/errors
end
W -> J : complete / partial failure with unresolved details
note over W,S
 APIs enforce expiry timestamps even before job runs.
 Multiple runners/manual retry cannot duplicate cycle/fee.
 Daily00:05 remains separate from frequent renewal worker.
 No purge/refund/reallocation of subscriber phone numbers.
end note
@enduml
